WEBVTT

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.970
I don't wanna wear this, meow, Mama!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.740
We have important guests coming.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.610
We must be dressed properly to receive them.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:22.110
But it's so hard to move.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.110
You, too, are a member of our exalted house,

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:27.780
so don't do anything shameful.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:34.620
Your elder brother and sister both 
grew up to be dutiful and refined,

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.670
so why is it that you...

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.750
Are you listening? Make sure to 
give your greetings properly.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.760
You've practiced your 
greetings, haven't you?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:38.050
<b>Step 5
"DIY" Means Finding a Place to Belong... Finally</b>

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.990
Okay. Let's go...

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:36.350
build a tree house.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:39.750
Do it...

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.700
Yourself!

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.400
Hi, there!

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.840
I came to play, meow!

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.810
You came through the roof to play?

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:58.660
Why did you meow?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.810
Ninja?!

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.290
Nice to meet you!

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.560
Nice to meet you!

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.870
Wait... What is all of this?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.200
I've been wondering about 
this place for a while.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.580
What a lovely vase hanger!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.980
That's right! This place...

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.080
is the DIY club, right?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.870
That's right! And DIY means...

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.390
Oh! I'm Yua Serufu!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.980
Yua Serufu?

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.770
<b>Jobko</b>

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.770
<b>Hikage 
Takumi</b>

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.770
<b>Yua Serufu</b>

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.770
<b>Yasaku Rei</b>

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.760
Oh, I see!

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:36.490
It's the perfect name for the DIY club.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.370
Nice to meet you, Serufucchi!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:42.230
I'm a first year at YuuYuu 
Girls' High, Kouki Kokoro.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.260
My nickname's Shii.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.220
Shii-chan!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.470
U-Um, I'm H-Hikage Takumi.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.310
And... I made that.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.600
Takumicchi, that's amazing!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.030
You're really skilled!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:02.320
Th-Thank you.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:03.960
Whoosh!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.390
Nin-nin!

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:06.970
I am Jobk—

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.260
Wait, wait, wait!

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.080
Why are you just accepting this and 
introducing yourselves like it's normal?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.110
Why would a YuuVoc student be here?

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:15.890
Like I said, I've been wondering 
about this place for a while.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.740
Even so...

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.640
Why did you come in through the <i>roof?</i>

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.270
About that!

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.410
From the school building over there...

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.250
the roof was the closest way in,

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.090
so I had no choice, meow!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:36.120
Don't worry! I disabled the security on the
 school's windows, so everything's fine!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.910
Is that really the issue here?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.700
Ninjas can disable security systems?

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.890
If you know the mechanisms 
involved, it's super easy!

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.920
Murmur, murmur, murmur, murmur, murmur...

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:48.170
I see. That's definitely a weak spot.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:51.150
We have to tell the security company.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:54.320
That's a ninja for you, a spy, a kunoichi!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.700
And that's the girl genius, 
Elizabethcchi, for you!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.730
I thought it might be you, but, meow!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.810
It's really you!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.990
I-I will allow you to address me as Jobko.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.290
Hi, Jobkocchi!

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.040
Hi, Shii!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.240
For the tree house...

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:16.460
it'd be fun to make it like the kind of 
secret hideout you'd make when you're little.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.800
Yes, a secret hideout. Exactly.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:21.520
Something like a ninja house 
might be good, too, right?

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.490
I'd love to build it with you, meow...

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.090
Hold on!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.840
Don't suddenly get all 
friendly with each other!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.470
Why not?

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.150
I think I'll probably be pretty helpful.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.070
This is the Gata Girls' DIY club, so...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:38.520
<b>Gatagata Girls' High School
DIY Club</b>

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.360
I think I'm stronger than everyone else here.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.270
Ahem!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.070
Shii, was it?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.600
I think saying "everyone" is going too far.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.410
I don't know about that, meow.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.370
Really...

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:51.880
Meow...

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.620
They're about to start dueling!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.400
Club leader! You can't use hammers, okay?

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.840
What're you talking about?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:01.870
Hey.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.370
I challenge you!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.900
Just what I was hoping for!

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.840
Ready?

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.170
<i>She took on the role of 
referee like it was nothing!</i>

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.310
Both of you, do your best!

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:17.230
Go!

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.610
I-It's a very close match!

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:35.980
What's this?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.070
Kokoro-san?

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:41.590
It's Haru-neechan, meow!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.450
It's been quite some time, hasn't it?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.230
How many years do you think?

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:54.060
That's right! You started working 
at Gata Girls', didn't you?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.600
Oh, you won, meow.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:02.740
Haruko-sensei and Shii-chan... 
How do you know each other?

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.190
Well, Kokoro-san and I...

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.880
Haru-neechan! I caught a koi!

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.550
My! Well done, Kokoro-san!

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.160
Do you think koi can eat sukonbu?

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:31.930
Well, let's see. It <i>is</i> seaweed,
 so maybe they can!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.240
Can I give it some?

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:37.550
Koi-san might think it's too sour,
 so perhaps we shouldn't.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:48.910
Which is why, when Kokoro-san was little 
and her parents came to Japan on business,

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.190
she came to play at my family's 
house a number of times.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:56.240
Haruko-sensei's family are wealthy, 
goushou-class merchants from the Tohoku region.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.030
They are?

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:01.470
Wow! Wealthy merchants? That's so cool!

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:02.940
Go show?

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.390
Great merchants.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.200
It's pretty much the same 
as your family, Jobkocchi.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.000
Oh, I see.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.370
And your parents, too, Kokoro-san.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.220
What?

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.590
The grounds of her family 
home in southeast Asia

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.720
are extensive, and the house has many rooms.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.790
Animals like tigers and lions roam free—

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.800
We don't have tigers or lions, meow.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.150
But that's still amazing!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.510
What about a ninja house?

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:26.820
Unfortunately, no.

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.680
Top secret? I understand.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:33.510
Still, to think you entered 
through the ceiling...

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.980
You're just as wild and 
adventurous as ever, I see.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.960
So that's why... maybe.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:40.390
What?

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:40.880
Huh?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:47.970
Oh, nothing. Just, YuuVoc has 
elite students from all over the world,

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:51.830
so, um, it seemed like they'd 
be hard to approach...

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.940
At least that's what I expected.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.020
Shii-chan is super friendly, isn't she?

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:02.990
I had no idea that Kokoro-san 
had enrolled at YuuVoc.

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.910
Are you living in the dorms?

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:05.990
Yup!

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:09.650
And, Haru-neechan, you're the 
advisor for the DIY club, right?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:13.740
I want to build a secret hideout
 with everyone. Can I?

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.480
A secret hideout?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.420
I see. That sounds like fun.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:22.780
A tree house that will serve 
as a symbol for the DIY club.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:28.540
Well, you will definitely have 
to draw up a proper plan for it.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.900
And you want to build it 
with them, is that right?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:32.880
Yeah!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:36.160
Haru-neechan, let's play!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.610
My brother and sister won't play with me...

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.400
I will grant you permission.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:45.870
Yay!

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:47.990
Isn't that great, Shii-chan?

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:48.700
Yeah.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:50.170
Then...

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:52.140
that brings our membership to five!

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.590
That means the DIY club is here to stay!

00:09:54.590 --> 00:10:00.290
No. Since she's from a different school, 
I can't accept her as an official member.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.050
Oh...

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:07.010
At most, Kokoro-san will 
be an outside club member.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.980
You were really strong when 
we were arm wrestling.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.800
I'm looking forward to working with you, Shii.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.250
Meow!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.680
<b>Kouki Kokoro
Jobko
Hikage Takumi
Yua Serufu
Yasaku Rei</b>

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:29.910
Putting up a name tag here in 
seconds... You're really impressive.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.640
Shii-chan, I hope you'll 
keep working with us.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.340
I look forward to working together.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:39.100
Well then, it's already getting late today, 
so why don't we leave things there?

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:40.750
And starting tomorrow,

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:44.110
we'll start drawing up a proper 
plan for the secret hideout.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.890
Okay! I'll see you tomorrow!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.390
Bye!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.430
She's amazing.

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.710
So cool!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:11.190
Kokoro-san! Make sure you come 
through the school gates tomorrow!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.610
She's something else.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.910
Kouki-san joined the DIY club? Why?

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.280
I don't know.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.270
Pudding, shouldn't you 
just ask her yourself?

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:23.270
Miku-san. Miku-san.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:27.630
Miku-san, about the new OS 
we spoke of the other day...

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.090
What is going on here?

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.120
Miku-san?

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.860
Miku-san?

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:35.000
The OS...

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.600
This beef tongue is delicious, isn't it?

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.460
This chicken soboro is delicious, too.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:43.650
Cows can chew on their own delicious 
tongues whenever they want.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.460
They must be so happy!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.560
Does one's own tongue have 
any flavor, I wonder?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.640
They can regurgitate it 
and chew it again, too!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.020
You don't have to worry.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.460
The food is good, and my classes are fun.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.460
Yeah.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:06.650
Well, say hi to my big 
brother and sister for me.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:11.150
Yeah, I will. Good night, Mama.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.140
A secret hideout...

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.130
I'm so excited, meow!

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.670
Excuse me, Kouki-san?

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:47.570
Meow? I said you can call 
me Shii. Just Shii.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:50.850
Shii... san.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:53.160
Something happen, Suridecchi?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:54.670
Well...

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.380
Huh?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.790
I heard that you joined the
Gata Girls' DIY club.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.610
Not that it matters to me. I just 
happened to hear about it, that's all.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.610
Not that it matters to me.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.220
I had them make me an outside club member!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.220
What? Why?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.290
I guess because it makes me kinda excited.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.470
And they seem like they have lots of fun.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.350
Are you interested?

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:23.520
Suridecchi, you could do 
it with me if you want.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.640
I'm sure they'd welcome you.

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:28.450
I-I would never!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:32.010
I have no interest in something like DIY.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.280
The coast's clear.

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:05.940
Hiya!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:10.860
Honestly. We told you come 
come in like a normal person.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.580
<b>Infirmary</b>

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.580
Well, then...

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.570
We shall now begin our meeting to discuss 
the plan for the secret hideout.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:22.020
I drew up some concept art!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.990
Wow.

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:25.400
That's amazing!

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.490
Wow, it's lovely!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.580
Nonsense! How is anyone 
supposed to make that?

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.330
Um, well...

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.230
It's a wonderful secret base, but...

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.980
Since we have the chance, 
we should make it a ninja house.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.050
That would be great, too!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.540
Well, we'll take your feelings 
into consideration, at least.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.690
I'd like to begin discussing 
this in more realistic terms.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:49.790
Okay!

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.470
First, about the size and 
layout of the secret base...

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:57.620
Materials

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:59.310
I looked into the bare minimum of materials 
and tools we'd need and made a rough list.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:03.190
We have most of the tools 
we need in the club room,

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.710
so we probably won't need to buy anything.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.470
Now, about the lumber...

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:10.020
We can use what we have in the club room,

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:13.950
and dismantle old desks and things 
that have been discarded.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:17.830
Then there's also unsalable items from 
my family's shop, Waku Waku Wan Wan.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.880
If we use what we can of those...

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:23.360
then I don't think we'll need 
to buy very much, but...

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.640
The problem is the TABs.

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:26.790
Question!

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:27.650
Serufu.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.320
What's a "TAB"?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.910
T-A-B, a tree attachment bolt.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.650
They're vital for building tree houses.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:38.000
And those TABs are...

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.410
Expensive.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.100
Right now, the budget allotted 
to the DIY club is...

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.490
80,000 yen.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:49.000
But just to buy the TABs, 
we'd need 120,000 to 130,000 yen.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.700
We don't have nearly enough.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.510
What? Is that all?

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.020
With this, cost doesn't matter.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:58.700
I can use my savings.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.530
We can't do that.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:06.760
Club activity funds and your personal 
finances must be kept strictly separated.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:11.430
Didn't you just say something about 
your family's unsalable items?

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.290
That's that, and this is this.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:19.040
And to make it work not through financial 
muscle, but through creative ingenuity...

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.120
That's the heart of DIY.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:26.460
Do it yourself!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.380
What happened?!

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:31.370
Let's start thinking about what to 
do about the money we lack.

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:32.590
Meow!

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.020
Shii.

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:39.220
So, if we managed to get our hands on more 
lumber, would that free up some money?

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.240
Of course.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:42.220
Because we wouldn't have to buy it.

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:44.270
Then I have a great idea!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.270
What?

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.290
This is the place!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.950
What's here?

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.890
These!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:58.350
What?

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.810
They're pallets used for moving things.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:06.460
It doesn't look like they're being used, 
so maybe they'll give them to us.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.770
I see.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.790
H-How did it go?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.550
They said we can take as many as we want.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.580
As to whether they're usable...

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.060
Let's take just a few and examine them.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.100
Okay!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.680
Okay, meow!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:30.140
These are heavy!

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.450
This is quite difficult, isn't it?

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.460
Leadercchi, you doing okay?

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.990
I'm fine.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.490
Jobko-chan, fight!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:52.180
Y-You can do it!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:58.280
It's no good. It won't come off.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:00.760
Let me try.

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.610
Watch.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.200
You do it... like this!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.600
That's how it works.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.140
Wow!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.710
That's amazing!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:23.490
That's our Leadercchi for you!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.230
Want to try it?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.190
Yeah!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:31.890
Hold it lower down.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:34.370
Yes. There. That's good.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.000
Use the principle of leverage...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.850
like you're scooping upwards...

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:40.310
Meow!

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:41.580
Meow?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.550
Okay!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:44.490
Shii-chan, you're really good at that!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:47.550
I get it. Okay, then...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.570
Kokoro-san is quite robust, isn't she?

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.060
She's got a knack for it.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.910
She's so cool!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.610
She's like a bulldozer.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.430
What do you think, club leader?

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.070
Well...

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.570
Shall we test it out?

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:18.480
Yes!

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:24.710
Then, I would like to use the 
pallet wood to make a wall shelf.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.520
Question, club leader!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.800
What's a wall shelf?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.770
Basically, they're wall-mounted shelves.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.400
They can hold small items,

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:36.270
or, if you add hooks, 
you can hang bags from them.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.980
That might be good!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.760
<b>Hook Board</b>

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.440
Some parts are rotten and can't be used,

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:47.290
but if we separate out what we
 can use and coordinate the sizes...

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.010
We can build our secret hideout!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.850
And it'll free up that 
much more money, right?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:57.050
Let's go grab all the pallets!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.200
This is all because of you, Shii.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:03.750
Thank you.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:10.370
You're very welcome, meow!

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:21.000
Everything's fine. I'm 
doing really well, meow.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:25.310
You don't have to worry, meow. Really.

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:28.010
I found something fun to do over here.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:32.520
Yeah. And I made friends.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.550
Yeah.

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:40.410
Okay. Good night.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:47.890
Don't worry. I've found a place 
where I feel like I belong.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:04.430
"A place to belong"... those are 
do-it-yourself, too! Meow!

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Step 6</b>

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>"DIY" Means Dull, Unexciting Items Come in Handy!</b>
